WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.269
Parity beats shallow quantum circuits.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.408
Constant depth, polynomially many qubits, one measured output.

3
00:00:06.558 --> 00:00:08.582
Shallow classical circuits already fail.

4
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.661
Go layer by layer, keeping influence local;

5
00:00:11.661 --> 00:00:13.770
the output's link to parity fades.

6
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.427
Claimed: no fixed advantage, for large inputs.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.359
Lean-checked main theorem.
